# The edits of compiler/habits_more.azl (docs/design/agents.md 1.5): forms of other languages whose
# repair needs more of the text than the place of the error. Each case that is repaired is built and
# run after `azol fix`, so the edit is known to keep what the program does; the cases that end with
# `no-fix` are shapes the edit must leave alone.
==== E1405: `for i in range(3)`
---- file a.azl
fn main() {
    var sum = 0
    for i in range(3) {
        sum = sum + i
    }
    print(sum)
}
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 1
---- reports E1405 3:14
---- run fix a.azl
---- exit 0
---- after-has a.azl
    for i in 0..3 {
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 0
---- prints a.azl
3
