==== E0127: a `for ( ; ; )` that counts down gets no edit
---- file a.azl
fn main() {
    var sum = 0
    for (var i = 3; i > 0; i--) {
        sum = sum + i
    }
    print(sum)
}
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 1
---- reports E0127 3:19
---- no-fix
